.TH WAVE-SHELLENV 1 "" "LinuxWave" "LinuxWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-shellenv \- Print the shell code that prepends LinuxWave's directories to PATH. You eval it once from your shell profile; it does nothing on its own.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave shellenv
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the shell code that prepends LinuxWave's directories to PATH. You
eval it once from your shell profile; it does nothing on its own.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
eval "$(~/.local/linuxwave/lib/wave shellenv)"
echo 'eval "$(~/.local/linuxwave/lib/wave shellenv)"' >> ~/.zprofile
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
